        ans: "<i>(આપેલ પરમાણ્વીય દળ: C=12, H=1, S=32, P=31, Cl=35.5, N=14, O=16 u)</i><br><br><b>(a) ઇથાઇન (C₂H₂):</b><br>= (2 × C) + (2 × H) = (2 × 12) + (2 × 1) = 24 + 2 = <span style='color:#0275d8; font-weight:bold;'>26 g/mol</span><br><br><b>(b) સલ્ફર અણુ (S₈):</b><br>= 8 × S = 8 × 32 = <span style='color:#0275d8; font-weight:bold;'>256 g/mol</span><br><br><b>(c) ફૉસ્ફરસ અણુ (P₄):</b><br>= 4 × P = 4 × 31 = <span style='color:#0275d8; font-weight:bold;'>124 g/mol</span><br><br><b>(d) હાઇડ્રોક્લોરિક ઍસિડ (HCl):</b><br>= H + Cl = 1 + 35.5 = <span style='color:#0275d8; font-weight:bold;'>36.5 g/mol</span><br><br><b>(e) નાઇટ્રિક ઍસિડ (HNO₃):</b><br>= H + N + (3 × O) = 1 + 14 + (3 × 16) = 15 + 48 = <span style='color:#0275d8; font-weight:bold;'>63 g/mol</span>"
